## Requirements

### Functional Requirements

- The system must accept the number of objects in each pile.
- The system must calculate the Nim-sum using the XOR operation.
- The system must identify winning and losing positions.
- The AI must select an optimal move from every winning position.
- The system must display the selected move.
- The system must handle different pile configurations.

### Non-Functional Requirements

- The system should provide fast responses.
- The system should be easy to use.
- The code should be simple and maintainable.
- The system should produce accurate results.
- The system should work using Python 3.x.

### Software Requirements

- Python 3.x
- GitHub
- Text Editor or IDE

### Hardware Requirements

- Computer or laptop
- Minimum 4 GB RAM
- Basic processor
- Keyboard and display
